                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more discernible"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "107d58bd-14fd-4c18-9a9a-8095d538971e",
                        "entry_id": "87a04b81-1fa6-3e79-b5d8-be64dfbc8d62",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most discernible"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eebd7667-6bb5-385b-9da7-626ff2a6db68",
                        "entry_id": "87a04b81-1fa6-3e79-b5d8-be64dfbc8d62",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Possible to discern; detectable or derivable by use of the senses or the intellect."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b16b51bf-098c-41da-95f7-486577808e46",
                                "sense_id": "eebd7667-6bb5-385b-9da7-626ff2a6db68",
                                "text": "There is a discernible performance difference between a Porsche and a Civic."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fd7b3d87-bbb0-4f3c-81a5-7ad40aa934e7",
                                "sense_id": "eebd7667-6bb5-385b-9da7-626ff2a6db68",
                                "text": "To have demolished and rebuilt the walls, would have been a very costly expedient, and as the least of two evils, the painter's brush was resorted to; here and there however, above some of the windows, the black wreathings of the smoke are still discernible through the white covering."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6363347-74bc-402f-a483-730ddb9817d3",
                                "sense_id": "eebd7667-6bb5-385b-9da7-626ff2a6db68",
                                "text": "So this was my future home, I thought![…]Backed by towering hills, the but faintly discernible purple line of the French boundary off to the southwest, a sky of palest Gobelin flecked with fat, fleecy little clouds, it in truth looked a dear little city; the city of one's dreams."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "37dcc4f0-ca77-45f0-bd03-91ebf07210fe",
                                "sense_id": "eebd7667-6bb5-385b-9da7-626ff2a6db68",
                                "text": "In 1995, the IPCC declared that the human impact on climate was now “discernible.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "74e5609d-43c4-4f05-a9e3-6f6ec56e235c",
                                "sense_id": "eebd7667-6bb5-385b-9da7-626ff2a6db68",
                                "text": "This magnificent picture really stopped me in my tracks when I stumbled across it. I was drawn inexorably and immediately into the compelling detail discernible on this top-quality image."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "12f4fc52-2b10-405c-8717-4fd970091128",
                        "source_entry_id": "87a04b81-1fa6-3e79-b5d8-be64dfbc8d62",
                        "source_sense_id": "eebd7667-6bb5-385b-9da7-626ff2a6db68",
